
---
import ChecklistItem from '../ChecklistItem.astro';
import InstructionNote from '../InstructionNote.astro';
---
            <!-- Section 7: Documentation -->
            <section id="implementation">
                <h2>Implementation</h2>
                

                <h3>Approved Accessibility Tools</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Contrast Checker</li>
                    <li>Evaluation Tool</li>
                    <li>Screen Reader</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Pre-Flight Audit Checklist</h3>
                <p>Before publishing any digital asset for Splitli, designers and content creators must verify the following:</p>
                <ul class="checklist">
        <ChecklistItem id="audit1" label="All body text meets a minimum 4.5:1 contrast ratio, and large text meets 3:1 contrast ratio against its background." />
        <ChecklistItem id="audit2" label="Interactive components such as buttons, icons, and form inputs meet the minimum 3:1 contrast ratio against adjacent colors." />
        <ChecklistItem id="audit3" label="All informative images include clear, descriptive alt text, and decorative images use empty alt attributes when appropriate." />
        <ChecklistItem id="audit4" label="Color is never used as the only method for conveying meaning, state, or status. Icons, text labels, or patterns are used in combination with color." />
        <ChecklistItem id="audit5" label="All videos include closed captions, and audio content includes text transcripts." />
        <ChecklistItem id="audit6" label="Pages use a logical heading hierarchy, clearly labeled form fields, and accessible navigation that supports keyboard users." />
        <ChecklistItem id="audit7" label="Content follows Splitli’s plain language guidelines, maintains a 6th–8th grade reading level, and avoids unnecessary jargon or complex sentence structures." />
                </ul>
            </section>